window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Five small town sisters. Five heart-stopping heroes. Five captivating stories that will make you smile, swoon, and fall in love with romance again!</p> <p>What’s inside the Cloverleigh Farms Collection?</p> <p>5 full-length, best-selling romances: Irresistible, Undeniable, Insatiable, Unbreakable, and Unforgettable</p> <p>BRAND NEW series content, including alternate POV scenes, recipes, and extended epilogues for EVERY story</p> <p>ALL NEW bonus chapter that answers the question, “Where are they now?”</p> <p>Whether you’re a return visitor or discovering Cloverleigh Farms for the first time, this collection has something for everyone!</p> <p>A single dad of three girls who falls for his boss’s daughter. Childhood friends to lovers. A K9 cop and the woman he always wanted. A second chance for a single mom returning home to start over. A sports hero with a tortured soul who falls for the girl back home he never forgot.</p> <p>Welcome to Cloverleigh Farms…</p> <p></p>"; 
